#: ../../source/tutorial_pages/silicon.rst:177
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Harmonic IFCs :math:`\\Phi_{\\mu\\nu}(i,j)` in the supercell are given in"
" the third column and the multiplicity :math:`P` is the number of times "
"each interaction :math:`(i, j)` occurs within the given cutoff radius. "
"For example, :math:`P = 2` for the pair :math:`(1x, 2x)` because the "
"distance :math:`r_{1,2}` is exactly the same as the distance "
":math:`r_{1,2'}` where the atom 2' is a neighboring image of atom 2 under"
" the periodic boundary condition. If you compare the magnitude of IFCs, "
"the values in the third column should be divided by :math:`P`."
msgstr ""

